Apple Computer's recently announced MessagePad 2000 handheld 
computer and Internet appliances from WYSE Technology, Boundless, 
Inc., and Lucky Gold Star, each of which uses the StrongARM SA-110 
high-speed, low-power microprocessor.  DIGITAL's PCI peripheral 
chips will also be demonstrated in practical solutions for PC-based 
videoconferencing, real-time video compression, and system 
expandability through PCI-to-PCI bridging.


DIGITAL PARTNER PAVILION

Booth L4202, North Hall, LVCC

Sponsored by DIGITAL and its Association of Software and Application 
Partners (ASAP), the booth showcases leading providers of complete 
business solutions on DIGITAL's high-performance platforms.  

DIGITAL and Microsoft, together with their data warehouse solution 
partners, will be showcasing two DIGITAL data mart solutions and a 
Microsoft SQL Server demonstration.  This technology demonstration 
includes data warehouse partners Informatica and Business Objects.

The Microsoft SQL Server demonstration includes the largest 
Bluecurve implementation to date, a 50 GB Microsoft SQL Server 
database.  The foundation of these demonstrations is a technology 
preview of Microsoft Windows NT Server 4.0 and Microsoft SQL Server 
6.5 database running on DIGITAL'S award-winning AlphaServer 8000 
series enterprise server with a 700 GB DIGITAL StorageWorks 
solution.  The AlphaServer 8000 series enterprise servers are 
capable of supporting up to 12 Alpha processors and 28 GB of memory.

Software developers can learn more about the valuable technical and 
marketing assistance programs available from ASAP by coming to the 
Partner Information Desk in the booth.


THE ALTAVISTA AIRSHIP

Overhead (and Hilton Hotel Meeting Rooms H10, H12)

